#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
apigee-modelrouting: Compile declarative Model Routing config files (modelrouting/*.yaml)
into Apigee Feature Templates (AFT) and optionally import them directly into Apigee
via `gcloud beta apigee apis import`.

Supports:
  - Deterministic 1:1 Model-to-Feature Heuristic (`<provider>/<model-version>` -> `target-<provider>-<model-version>.yaml`)
  - Multi-provider `model_list` (with rpm/tpm quotas & automatic brand-new model/version feature synthesis)
  - `router_settings`: routing_strategy, num_retries, retry_after, timeout, cooldown_time,
    ordered `fallbacks` priority chains, `context_window_fallbacks`, `content_policy_fallbacks`
  - `gateway_settings.semantic_cache`: Vertex Vector Search semantic caching (`llm-semantic-cache.yaml`)
  - `gateway_settings.model_armor`: Google Cloud Model Armor prompt/response sanitization (`llm-model-armor.yaml`)
  - `gateway_settings.auth`:
      * `vertex_auth: google_service_account` -> native `<GoogleAccessToken>` on Vertex AI targets
      * `provider_keys: kvm` -> encrypted Apigee KVM vault lookup (`llm-auth-kvm.yaml`)
      * `client_auth: api_key` -> northbound consumer API key verification (`llm-client-auth.yaml`)
  - `gateway_settings.token_analytics`: Multi-provider token breakdown (prompt, completion, cached,
    reasoning, total) recorded via Apigee `DataCollector` (`llm-token-analytics.yaml`)
  - `auto_router/complexity_router`: Semantic intent classification via Flash-Lite (`llm-semantic-router.yaml`)
"""

